(Calcutta)", "location_name_detailed": "Kolkata (Calcutta), India"}, "is_verified": false}, "images": [], "created_at_date": "2019-02-04", "published_at_date": "2019-02-04"}, {"review_id": 649851116, "review_link": "https://www.tripadvisor.com/ShowUserReviews-g293890-d310712-r649851116-Pashupatinath_Temple-Kathmandu_Kathmandu_Valley_Bagmati_Zone_Central_Region.html", "title": "Hindu Temple", "text": "i was so happy to visit Pashupati Nath Temple because it was one of my dream, but i must say that there are scammers inside the temple as well. One local person cheated me inside the temple by saying that he will arrange pooja's , he did that but charges  me a lot. So its my advice that be cautions inside the temple as well", "review_tip": null, "rating": 4, "subratings": [], "like_count": 1, "language": "en", "is_translated": false, "original_language": "en", "owner_response": null, "trip": {"trip_type": "solo", "stay_date": "2018-03-31"}, "reviewer": {"reviewer_id": "3585FAB142BE80B39F57A665CE82579D", "name": "Jith M R", "profile_link": "https://www.tripadvisor.com/Profile/jithmr", "username": "jithmr", "avatar": "https://dynamic-media-cdn.tripadvisor.com/media/photo-o/16/46/3c/aa/jith-m.jpg", "contribution_count": 28, "hometown": {"tripadvisor_entity_id": 294009, "location_name": "Doha", "location_name_detailed": "Doha, Qatar"}, "is_verified": false}, "images": [], "created_at_date": "2019-02-03", "published_at_date": "2019-02-03"}, {"review_id": 649764049, "review_link": "https://www.tripadvisor.com/ShowUserReviews-g293890-d310712-r649764049-Pashupatinath_Temple-Kathmandu_Kathmandu_Valley_Bagmati_Zone_Central_Region.html", "title": "interesting", "text": "we just visited the temple and not the surrounding structures, as they had some rituals going on and the place was crowded by locals.\nso maybe the timing was wrong.\nthe temple as i said too crowded, the path was not clean and very difficult to do puja or darshan. only hindu will be allowed inside the temple, \nluckly we were helped by someone and able to do darshan atleast. \nmaybe will visit again later, to see the temple complex when its not so crowded\n\nno photography allowed inside the temple", "review_tip": null, "rating": 4, "subratings": [], "like_count": 0, "language": "en", "is_translated": false, "original_language": "en", "owner_response": null, "trip": {"trip_type": "family", "stay_date": "2018-12-31"}, "reviewer": {"reviewer_id": "1C7BD1CF0BC51FE9792B3B3DAC603587", "name": "sananda ghoshal", "profile_link": "https://www.tripadvisor.com/Profile/sans_gh", "username": "sans_gh", "avatar": "https://dynamic-media-cdn.tripadvisor.com/media/photo-o/32/87/b0/8c/caption.jpg", "contribution_count": 2322, "hometown": {"tripadvisor_entity_id": 304558, "location_name": "Kolkata (Calcutta)", "location_name_detailed": "Kolkata (Calcutta), India"}, "is_verified": false}, "images": ["https://dynamic-media-cdn.tripadvisor.com/media/photo-o/16/55/00/73/on-the-way-to-the-temple.jpg", "https://dynamic-media-cdn.tripadvisor.com/media/photo-o/16/55/00/78/temple-entrane.jpg", "https://dynamic-media-cdn.tripadvisor.com/media/photo-o/16/55/00/81/crowded-with-locals-for.jpg"], "created_at_date": "2019-02-03", "published_at_date": "2019-02-03"}, {"review_id": 649443017, "review_link": "https://www.tripadvisor.com/ShowUserReviews-g293890-d310712-r649443017-Pashupatinath_Temple-Kathmandu_Kathmandu_Valley_Bagmati_Zone_Central_Region.html", "title": "Imagine this as a little Varanasi", "text": "As this was where we witnessed our first open pyre creamation.Only Hindus are allowed into the temple.Typical temple setting where one would need lots of change as you are expected to contribute at every turn.\nThe funerals are carried out on the river bank. Those not entering the temple view the funerals from the outside.Not for the faint hearted.", "review_tip": null, "rating": 4, "subratings": [], "like_count": 2, "language": "en", "is_translated": false, "original_language": "en", "owner_response": null, "trip": {"trip_type": "couples", "stay_date": "2019-01-31"}, "reviewer": {"reviewer_id": "E59A459A9F1E6AAD53304524ADB8732E", "name": "SonoraSouthAfrica", "profile_link": "https://www.tripadvisor.com/Profile/SonoraSouthAfrica", "username": "SonoraSouthAfrica", "avatar": "https://dynamic-media-cdn.tripadvisor.com/media/photo-o/04/60/fb/bc/sonorasouthafrica.jpg", "contribution_count": 245, "hometown": null, "is_verified": false}, "images": [], "created_at_date": "2019-02-01", "published_at_date": "2019-02-01"}, {"review_id": 649027462, "review_link": "https://www.tripadvisor.com/ShowUserReviews-g293890-d310712-r649027462-Pashupatinath_Temple-Kathmandu_Kathmandu_Valley_Bagmati_Zone_Central_Region.html", "title": "Very interesting - not for the faint hearted", "text": "Many open air cremations at different stages were taking place while we were there. Bodies were being prepared for the afterlife by the river-side. Sadhus, tourists, pilgrims, mourners and picnickers milling around. If you are from a culture unused to dealing with death so openly, or sensitive to smoke, queasy about grey-faced corpses being fed with rice water or if you have have young children... be prepared for an eye opening experience. Well worth the visit albeit potentially a little disturbing. ", "review_tip": null, "rating": 5, "subratings": [], "like_count": 1, "language": "en", "is_translated": false, "original_language": "en", "owner_response": null, "trip": {"trip_type": "family", "stay_date": "2019-01-31"}, "reviewer": {"reviewer_id": "C21F306D0D3352372842E753B059DB2E", "name": "Tet1a", "profile_link": "https://www.tripadvisor.com/Profile/Letet1a", "username": "Letet1a", "avatar": "https://dynamic-media-cdn.tripadvisor.com/media/photo-o/1a/f6/e7/99/default-avatar-2020-57.jpg", "contribution_count": 93, "hometown": {"tripadvisor_entity_id": 255060, "location_name": "Sydney", "location_name_detailed": "Sydney, Australia"}, "is_verified": false}, "images": ["https://dynamic-media-cdn.tripa